Upstream patch dwm-resizehere-20230824-e81f17d.diff (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/resizehere/),
applied in this order to dwm 6.5.
Merged by hand with dragmfact's resizemouse(): a floating window resizes from
where the pointer is, a tiled one still sets the master area.

